      "description": "<p>When destroyed, a sporeborn skull explodes in a blast of bone and toxic spores that deals 1d6 Piercing Damage]{1d6 piercing damage plus 1d6 poison} damage to each adjacent creature (Basic DC 18 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>",
